    "csv.guide.common": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use UTF-8, optionally with a BOM; separate fields with commas; use LF or CRLF line endings. The first two CSV records in a template are labeled instruction records, and the third record is the actual column header. AI-generated CSV files may omit the instruction records and begin with the header. Each data row must contain one record of the selected type. Do not duplicate, add, or omit columns, or include titles, totals, examples, formulas, or Markdown code fences. A header-only template imports no records.\nIf a cell contains a comma, quotation mark, or line break, enclose the entire cell in double quotation marks; represent an internal double quote with two double quotes. Keep delimiters for empty cells. Maximum file size: 50,000,000 bytes.\n\nFields common to all tables\nID: Required valid UUID, for example 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111. Generate a new ID for each new record, and preserve the same ID when re-exporting a record. Duplicate IDs within the same file cause the whole import batch to be rejected. IDs already in the ledger are skipped without overwriting. Generating a new ID creates a new record.\nCurrency: Required three-letter uppercase original currency code, for example USD, CNY, RUB, or EUR. Do not use currency symbols or Chinese names.\nBaseCurrency: Required. Enter %@ in every row; it must match the ledger's base currency at import time. If the base currency changes, re-verify all converted values.\nExchangeRate: Positive exchange rate from original currency to base currency: 1 Currency = ExchangeRate BaseCurrency, not a quote per 100 units. For the same currency, leave blank or enter 1; for different currencies, the rate is required. Maximum six decimal places; maximum 1000000000. Never guess a historical rate or substitute today's rate; the app will not look up missing rates online.\nAmount / Principal: Required positive original-currency amount / principal, with at most two decimal places and no more than 1000000000000. Use a period as the decimal separator; no thousands separators, signs, currency symbols, or scientific notation. Round converted base-currency amounts to two decimals without exceeding the limit or rounding to zero.\nNote: Optional free-text note. Account information may be explicitly included here. Do not include reserved internal markers beginning with [FT.\nDate / StartDate / MaturityDate / NextExecutionDate / EndDate: Use YYYY-MM-DD or an ISO 8601 timestamp with an explicit time zone, e.g., 2026-10-01T12:30:00+03:00. Excel serial dates, slash-separated dates, and timestamps without a time zone are not accepted. Date-only values are stored at midnight UTC; time-zone-qualified timestamps preserve their actual instant.\nTitle / BankName / Category: Required nonempty names, up to 100 characters. Use the category name without its icon. Referenced categories are registered on import; income and expense categories with the same name are managed separately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UTF-8，可带 BOM；英文逗号分隔；LF/CRLF 换行；模板前两条CSV记录为带标记的说明区，正式表头为第三条；AI输出也可省去说明区、直接以列名开头。明细一行一条对应类型的数据。禁止重复、增加、遗漏列；不得加入标题、合计、示例、公式或 Markdown 围栏。只有表头的模板不导入任何记录。\n单元格含逗号、双引号或换行时，整格用双引号包围，内部双引号写成两个双引号。空值仍保留分隔符。文件上限 50,000,000 字节。\n\n所有表共用字段\nID：必填，有效 UUID；例如 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111。每条新记录生成一个，同一记录重导时保持原 ID。同文件重复 ID 阻止整批导入，账本中已有 ID 跳过且不覆盖。重新生成 ID 会产生新记录。\nCurrency：必填，原始货币的三位大写字母代码，例如 USD、CNY、RUB、EUR。不能填货币符号或中文名。\nBaseCurrency：必填，每行填写 %@，须与导入时账本本位币一致。改变本位币后须重新核实所有换算值。\nExchangeRate：原币到本位币的正数汇率，1 Currency = ExchangeRate BaseCurrency；不是每100单位报价。同币可空或填1，异币必填；最多六位小数，最大1000000000。不得猜测或用今日汇率代替历史汇率；软件不会联网补全。\nAmount / Principal：原币金额 / 原币本金，必填正数，最多两位小数且不超过1000000000000。英文小数点，不带千位分隔符、正负号、货币符号或科学计数法。换算为本币时四舍五入到两位，不得溢出上限或舍入为0。\nNote：选填，自由备注；账户信息可明确附于此。不允许填写软件内部的 [FT 开头标记。\nDate / StartDate / MaturityDate / NextExecutionDate / EndDate：YYYY-MM-DD 或带明确时区的ISO 8601时间，例如2026-10-01T12:30:00+03:00；不接受Excel日期序号、斜线日期和无时区时间。纯日期按UTC零点保存，带时区时间按其实际时间点保存。\nTitle / BankName / Category：必填非空名称，最多100字符，分类只写名称不加图标；导入提交时会登记所引用的分类，收入与支出同名分类分别管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
