    "csv.guide.deposits.ruleTitle": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deposit-Specific Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存款表专有规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "csv.guide.deposits.rules": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BankName: Bank name. Principal: Original-currency principal. AnnualInterestRate: Required annual percentage between 0 and 100, with at most four decimal places. Use 3.5 for 3.5%, not 0.035.\nStartDate: Deposit opening date. MaturityDate: Maturity date, which must be later than StartDate.\nInterestSettlementMode: Must be exactly At Maturity (interest paid at maturity), Monthly (monthly interest payments), or Monthly Compound (monthly compounding), matching the source contract.\nExpectedInterest: Optional expected total interest in original currency; nonnegative with at most two decimal places. When blank, the app calculates it using its own term and interest rules. When explicitly provided, it preserves the manually estimated interest and derives the matching annual rate under the app's rules.\nInterestExchangeRate: Rate for converting expected interest to the base currency, with the same format as ExchangeRate. Required for different currencies; blank or 1 for the same currency. This rate is independent of the principal rate. Do not guess.\nImport creates a new managed deposit with its principal and expected interest. Do not fabricate already paid interest or rollover history based on the source sheet. Importing does not create income or expense transactions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BankName：银行名称。Principal：原币本金。AnnualInterestRate：必填，0到100的年化百分数，最多四位小数，3.5表示3.5%，不能写0.035来表示3.5%。\nStartDate：起存日；MaturityDate：到期日，必须晚于起存日。\nInterestSettlementMode：仅 At Maturity（到期付息）、Monthly（按月付息）、Monthly Compound（按月复利），须与原表合同一致。\nExpectedInterest：选填，原币预计总利息，非负且最多两位小数；空白时软件按本身的存期/计息规则计算，明确填写时按手工预计利息保留，并沿用软件规则反推匹配的年化利率。\nInterestExchangeRate：预计利息到本位币的汇率，格式同ExchangeRate；异币必填，同币可空或1。与本金汇率独立，禁止猜测。\n导入为新的受管理存款，保留本金和预计利息；不凭表格伪造已付利息或续存历史，导入动作不生成收支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "csv.guide.examplesHeading": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Four Example Types (Illustrative Only; Do Not Include in Blank Templates; All Data Is Fictional)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "四类示例（仅说明，不放入空白模板；均为虚构数据）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "csv.guide.footer": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import and Export\nAfter selecting a type, blank templates and data exports contain only that type's nondeleted data. A data export is a single-table CSV in the app's original format, additionally retaining original/base-currency snapshots, status, timestamps, and system linkage fields, and can be reimported unchanged. It serves a different purpose from the simplified v1 template for AI-created records. Do not remove or modify these system fields or force original-format exported data into a simplified template, or historical state could be lost.\nLegacy multi-section full CSV files can be imported via a separate compatibility option. A type-specific import rejects mixed files. Full restoration still requires a .fintrack backup.\nImport first validates the entire file, then previews it and merges upon confirmation. Errors prevent the entire batch from being saved. The preview shows the type and first five records; check amounts, currencies, and exchange rates before confirming. Existing IDs are skipped without updating old records. Legacy regular-transaction CSV files remain supported, but if stable IDs are absent, importing them again can duplicate transactions.\n\nInstructions for AI Conversion\nAnalyze the attached source ledger (Excel, PDF, image, text, etc.) and generate separate FinTrack v1 CSV files for transactions, deposits, loans, and recurring transactions according to all rules above. Create a downloadable .csv file only for types actually present in the source, one file per type; never mix types. Preserve all corresponding English column headers.\nDistinguish completed transactions from schedule definitions. Exclude totals, subtotals, balances, and duplicate displays. Never count deposit or loan principal as income or expenses, and never merge two genuinely distinct transactions just because the amounts match. List accounts, budgets, goals, and unknown types separately as unsupported items.\nIf a required value, historical exchange rate, settlement mode, repayment method, income/expense direction, or date is missing or ambiguous, ask me before proceeding. Never guess, fabricate, fill with zero, or silently drop rows. List unresolved items separately and keep them out of the CSV.\nGenerate a valid UUID for each new record. Maintain a stable mapping for external transaction IDs and reuse IDs on subsequent conversions. Report source-row counts, exported counts, excluded counts, and unresolved counts by type; reconcile total amounts or principal by currency. Do not put explanations or Markdown fences inside the output CSV files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入与导出\n选择类型后，空白模板和数据导出都只包含该类型的未删除数据。数据导出为软件原格式的单表CSV，额外保留原币/本币快照、状态、时间戳与系统关联字段，可原样重导；它与供AI建立新记录的简化v1模板用途不同。不要删改这些系统字段或把原格式数据套入简化模板，以免丢失历史状态。\n旧版多分区完整CSV可通过单独的兼容入口导入；选定类型的入口拒绝混合文件。完整恢复仍使用.fintrack备份。\n导入先校验整文件，再预览，确认后合并；错误会阻止本批保存。预览显示类型和前五条记录，确认前核对金额、币种和汇率。已有ID跳过，不更新旧记录。旧普通收支CSV仍兼容，但无稳定ID时重复导入可能重复入账。\n\n可直接交给AI的转换指令\n请分析附带的原始账本（Excel、PDF、图片、文本等），根据以上FinTrack v1规则分别生成记账、存款、贷款、周期记账CSV；只生成原表确有数据的文件，每类一个可下载.csv，严禁混表。保留相应全部英文表头。\n先区分已发生交易与规则定义，排除合计、小计、余额、重复展示，不能把存款或贷款再算作收入/支出，也不要擅自合并两笔真实相同金额的记录。账户、预算、目标和未知类型单独列为不支持项。\n缺失必填值、历史汇率、计息方式、还款方式、收支方向或日期有歧义时，先向我确认；不得猜测、编造、补0或静默丢行。待确认项单独列清单，不能混入CSV。\n每条新记录生成有效UUID；已有外部流水号需保留稳定映射，重新转换复用ID。按类型报告原始明细数、输出数、排除及待确认数，按币种核对金额/本金合计。输出文件中不要附解释和Markdown围栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "csv.guide.introduction": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; structured CSV explanatory copy; protocol field names must stay byte-exact",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FinTrack Single-Type CSV Format v1 / Ledger Preparation Instructions\n\nCurrent ledger base currency: %@\nEach blank CSV template already includes the AI instructions, field rules, and base currency for its type. Give the source ledger and the matching template to the AI; no separate instruction file is needed. CSV files have no worksheets. Save transactions, deposits, loans, and recurring transactions as four separate files. In the app, select the data type before importing the matching file. Do not mix types.\n\nHeaders for all four types (retain every column with exact capitalization; column order may vary)\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FinTrack 独立 CSV 格式 v1 / 账本整理指令\n\n当前账本本位币：%@\n每个空白 CSV 内已包含对应类型的 AI 指令、字段规则和本位币；只需将原始账本与该模板交给 AI，无需单独说明文件。CSV 没有工作表；记账、存款、贷款、周期记账分别保存为四个文件。在软件中先选择数据类型，再导入对应文件，不得混用。\n\n四类表头（全部列须保留，大小写一致，顺序可调整）\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
