    "mac.currencyRebaseView.body.ec540c616d": {
      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; Sources/Features/Settings/Views/MacCurrencyRebaseView.swift:21; Text, Text(\"将按原币金额重算现有账目（包括手动本币金额）、金融规则、目标、初始资产与月度预算；准备阶段不写入，确认时先创建原生完整备份。\").appFont, VStack",
