      "comment": "v1.5 pending English; Sources/Features/Deposits/Views/MacDepositsView.swift:135; Text, Text(\"外币利息按每次结息日期获取汇率，保留独立的记账快照。\").appFont, Text(\"外币利息按每次结息日期获取汇率，保留独立的记账快照。\").appFont(.caption, weight: .regular).foregroundStyle",
